%% Sprint Studies-Reform — State diagram: routing entre sub-views (RF-01)
%% Spec: Docs/specs/sprint-studies-reform.md (RF-01, RF-03, RF-06)
%% ADR: 067 (URL state pattern + sub-paths Wouter)
%% Estados: cada view + estados especiais (Loading, Error, Onboarding, Filter applied)
%% Triggers: URL change, sidebar/bottom-nav click, query param, deep link, browser back/forward

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RouteResolution: User abre /estudos*<br/>(qualquer sub-path)

    RouteResolution --> OnboardingGate: layout monta<br/>useQuery themes/spots/snapshots
    OnboardingGate --> Onboarding: D8 conditions met<br/>(no themes + no snapshots + no spots<br/>+ !localStorage flag)
    OnboardingGate --> ViewSelection: dados existentes<br/>OU flag set

    Onboarding --> ViewSelection: completed OR skipped<br/>localStorage flag set

    ViewSelection --> Dashboard: location = '/estudos'<br/>OR '/estudos/dashboard'
    ViewSelection --> Themes: location startsWith '/estudos/temas'<br/>(sem :id)
    ViewSelection --> ThemesWithFilter: location = '/estudos/temas'<br/>+ ?fromStats=leaks (D11)
    ViewSelection --> ThemeDetail: location = '/estudos/temas/:id'<br/>(rota existente)
    ViewSelection --> Stats: location = '/estudos/stats'
    ViewSelection --> Spots: location = '/estudos/spots'
    ViewSelection --> Recommendations: location = '/estudos/recomendacoes'
    ViewSelection --> CatchAllRedirect: location matches /estudos/* invalid<br/>(ex: /estudos/foo)

    CatchAllRedirect --> Dashboard: navigate('/estudos/dashboard')<br/>telemetry: studies.deep_linked<br/>{source:'invalid_route'}

    %% ===== DASHBOARD =====
    Dashboard --> Loading: useQuery 5 secoes<br/>(continue + insights + spots + recs + streak)
    Loading --> Dashboard: todas resolvidas
    Loading --> ErrorPartial: alguma secao falhou<br/>(lesson #9 — falha por secao)

    Dashboard --> Themes: click sidebar/bottom-nav "Temas"<br/>OR continue card click
    Dashboard --> Stats: click sidebar/bottom-nav "Stats"
    Dashboard --> Spots: click sidebar/bottom-nav "Spots"<br/>OR PendingSpotsPreview card click
    Dashboard --> Recommendations: click sidebar/bottom-nav "Recomendacoes"<br/>OR RecommendationsPreview card click
    Dashboard --> ThemeDetail: ContinueWhereLeftOff card click<br/>navigate /estudos/temas/:id?tab=:tabId
    Dashboard --> SpotReviewModal: PendingSpotsPreview thumbnail click

    %% ===== THEMES =====
    Themes --> ThemesWithFilter: query param ?fromStats=leaks adicionado<br/>(navigate from StatsView botao)
    ThemesWithFilter --> Themes: click "Limpar filtro"<br/>navigate sem query param
    Themes --> ThemeDetail: click theme card
    ThemesWithFilter --> ThemeDetail: click theme card

    Themes --> CreateThemeFlow: click "Criar tema"
    CreateThemeFlow --> Themes: dialog close<br/>+ refetch list

    %% ===== STATS (wrapper para Sess 3) =====
    Stats --> ThemesWithFilter: click "Sugerir temas baseado em leaks"<br/>navigate /estudos/temas?fromStats=leaks
    note right of Stats
        Wrapper RF-04 monta StatsAnalyzerTab
        intacto (Sess 3 — zona protegida).
        Botao "Sugerir temas" desabilitado
        se leaks=[] (consulta paralela
        /api/dashboard/leaks/active).
    end note

    %% ===== SPOTS =====
    Spots --> SpotReviewModal: click spot thumbnail
    SpotReviewModal --> SpotLinkFlow: dropdown "Vincular tema" selected
    SpotLinkFlow --> Spots: submit OK<br/>spot some do filtro<br/>(reviewLater=true AND theme_id IS NULL)
    SpotReviewModal --> Spots: submit sem theme<br/>(opcional)
    SpotReviewModal --> ErrorCrossUser: theme_id de outro user<br/>(403)
    ErrorCrossUser --> SpotReviewModal: toast erro<br/>retry possivel

    Spots --> SpotsWithShowAll: toggle "Mostrar todos"<br/>?showAll=1
    SpotsWithShowAll --> Spots: toggle off<br/>?showAll removido

    %% ===== RECOMMENDATIONS =====
    Recommendations --> RecommendationsLoading: useQuery (cold cache)
    RecommendationsLoading --> Recommendations: data ready
    RecommendationsLoading --> RecommendationsEmpty: items.length === 0
    Recommendations --> RecommendationsEmpty: items.length === 0

    Recommendations --> RecommendationsFiltered: filter ?type=leak|stale_spot|dormant_theme
    RecommendationsFiltered --> Recommendations: filter cleared

    Recommendations --> ThemeDetail: card cta_action=open_theme
    Recommendations --> SpotReviewModal: card cta_action=review_spot
    Recommendations --> CreateThemeFlow: card cta_action=create_theme

    RecommendationsEmpty --> Themes: CTA "Continuar estudando ultimos temas"

    %% ===== THEME DETAIL =====
    ThemeDetail --> ThemeDetailWithSpots: aba "Spots vinculados" (RF-05)<br/>GET /api/study-themes/:id/linked-spots
    ThemeDetailWithSpots --> SpotReviewModalReadonly: click spot vinculado
    SpotReviewModalReadonly --> SpotReviewModal: click "Editar conclusao"
    SpotReviewModal --> ThemeDetailWithSpots: submit (re-fetch linked-spots)

    ThemeDetail --> Themes: back-button OR sidebar click
    ThemeDetail --> ActivityBumped: useStudyActivityInvalidation<br/>onThemeOpen → invalida cache recomendacoes<br/>+ bumpStudyStreak (D3)
    ActivityBumped --> ThemeDetail: silently (no UI change)

    %% ===== QUICK SEARCH (RF-09) =====
    Dashboard --> QuickSearchOpen: Cmd/Ctrl+K
    Themes --> QuickSearchOpen: Cmd/Ctrl+K
    Stats --> QuickSearchOpen: Cmd/Ctrl+K
    Spots --> QuickSearchOpen: Cmd/Ctrl+K
    Recommendations --> QuickSearchOpen: Cmd/Ctrl+K
    ThemeDetail --> QuickSearchOpen: Cmd/Ctrl+K

    QuickSearchOpen --> QuickSearchSearching: user types
    QuickSearchSearching --> QuickSearchOpen: backspace empty
    QuickSearchOpen --> Dashboard: Esc OR navigate Dashboard
    QuickSearchOpen --> Themes: Enter on theme item
    QuickSearchOpen --> ThemeDetail: Enter on tab item
    QuickSearchOpen --> SpotReviewModal: Enter on spot item
    QuickSearchOpen --> CreateThemeFlow: Enter on action "Criar tema"

    %% ===== ERROR STATES =====
    Loading --> ErrorFatal: timeout OR 500
    ErrorFatal --> Dashboard: retry button click

    ErrorPartial --> Dashboard: secao com erro renderiza<br/>"Falha ao carregar [secao].<br/>[Recarregar]"<br/>outras secoes OK

    %% ===== BROWSER NAVIGATION =====
    Dashboard --> RouteResolution: browser back<br/>OR popstate event
    Themes --> RouteResolution: browser back
    ThemesWithFilter --> RouteResolution: browser back
    Stats --> RouteResolution: browser back
    Spots --> RouteResolution: browser back
    Recommendations --> RouteResolution: browser back
    ThemeDetail --> RouteResolution: browser back

    %% ===== EXIT (sair de /estudos/*) =====
    Dashboard --> [*]: navigate fora /estudos<br/>(ex: /grind, /coach)
    Themes --> [*]: navigate fora
    Stats --> [*]: navigate fora
    Spots --> [*]: navigate fora
    Recommendations --> [*]: navigate fora

    note left of QuickSearchOpen
        Cmd/Ctrl+K listener vive
        no StudiesLayout.useEffect.
        Removido em unmount —
        nao polui resto do app.
    end note

    note right of OnboardingGate
        D8: pula automatico se
        themes.length &gt;= 1 OR
        snapshots.length &gt;= 1 OR
        starredHands.length &gt;= 1.
        Flag localStorage:
        grindfy:studies:onboarding_completed
    end note

    note left of ThemesWithFilter
        D11: cross-link Stats→Themes
        via ?fromStats=leaks.
        Filtro: somente themes com
        attacks_leak_type populado,
        ordenados por severidade
        do leak vinculado.
    end note

    note right of CatchAllRedirect
        /estudos/foo (qualquer rota
        invalida sob /estudos/*)
        redireciona para Dashboard.
        Lesson #9: log antes do redirect.
    end note

    note right of ActivityBumped
        D3: ad-hoc on activity.
        Triggers:
        - ThemeDetail mount
        - Snapshot create
        - Spot review submit
        Bump idempotente por dia.
    end note
